OL,6,     GEdith Bowman brings her Shiny
OL,7,     GHappy Playlist, 30 minutes of
OL,8,     Gfeel-good music from 7-7.30pm to
OL,9,     Gsoundtrack listeners' weekday
OL,10,     Gevening.
OL,11,G1930FEdith Bowman
OL,12,     GEdith Bowman sits in, handpicking
OL,13,     Gher favourite new music from all
OL,14,     Ggenres of the musical spectrum
OL,15,     Gand quality vintage songs too.
OL,16,G2100FThe Blues Show with Cerys Matthews
